b-practice-targets walkthrough — procedure verification (no Docker on this machine)
Date: 2026-10-09 · Tool versions: curl 8.5.0, python3 3.12.3
Environment: loopback only. `command -v docker` -> MISSING (verified).

Step 1 — Fetched all five canonical project READMEs in-session (HTTP 200):
  - https://github.com/digininja/DVWA (579,235 chars)
  - https://github.com/juice-shop/juice-shop (494,099 chars)
